	(text "Status LED - Active-LOW Sink Control"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 38.1 66.802 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
		)
		(uuid "f48fd7ae-4427-49d3-9fe8-45af84039a48")
	)
	(text_box "• Control: BSS138 N-MOSFET (Active-HIGH PWM, typ. 4 kHz)\n• Safety: 10 kΩ gate pull-down prevents parasitic chirp at boot\n• Supply: +3.3V logic rail | Low-current piezo (< 10 mA)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 97.282 100.33 0)
		(size 72.898 8.0376)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
		(stroke
			(width 0)
			(type solid)
		)
		(fill
			(type none)
		)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "0e5ff1ca-780d-433d-857c-22f69f7eb349")
	)
	(text_box "• Window thresholds (LTC4365, Recovery delay: 36 ms, 5% hysteresis, Max 16V for MCP1703 LDO):\n  - [Default] 2S & 3S Compatible: UVLO = 5.90V (6.20V rise) | OVLO = 14.75V (14.01V fall) -> R_top=2.7MΩ, R_mid=150kΩ, R_bot=100kΩ\n  - 2S LiPo Optimized (7.4V):     UVLO = 6.45V (6.78V rise) | OVLO = 10.84V (10.30V fall) -> R_top=2.0MΩ, R_mid=68kΩ,  R_bot=100kΩ\n  - 3S LiPo Optimized (11.1V):    UVLO = 9.15V (9.61V rise) | OVLO = 14.28V (13.57V fall) -> R_top=2.7MΩ, R_mid=56kΩ,  R_bot=100kΩ\n  - 9V Battery (6LR61 / Li-Ion):  UVLO = 5.50V (5.78V rise) | OVLO = 11.00V (10.45V fall) -> R_top=2.0MΩ, R_mid=100kΩ, R_bot=100kΩ\n• Protection: Reverse polarity to -40V (Back-to-back N-MOS) & 30V TVS clamp\n• SHDN_EXT: Active-LOW (<0.4V = Sleep <10µA, 510kΩ pull-up to VIN)\n• NFAULT_EXT: Open-drain active-LOW (Requires external pull-up on host board)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 17.78 173.9899 0)
		(size 152.4 19.0501)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
		(stroke
			(width 0)
			(type solid)
		)
		(fill
			(type none)
		)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "26ad32c9-1212-4635-8495-19d0026d503a")
	)
	(text_box "• Output: +3.3V ±0.4% | I_max = 250 mA | I_q = 2 µA\n• Input: Supplied from protected VM rail (Max 16V continuous)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 17.78 52.07 0)
		(size 76.2 5.9929)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
		(stroke
			(width 0)
			(type solid)
		)
		(fill
			(type none)
		)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "646492e9-3945-4476-9bc4-ebd238564d0b")
	)
	(text_box "• Antiparallel LEDs across OUTA/OUTB (2kΩ ballast)\n• Indicates rotation direction (polarity) and PWM duty cycle"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 97.282 51.816 0)
		(size 72.644 5.9929)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
		(stroke
			(width 0)
			(type solid)
		)
		(fill
			(type none)
		)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "946e5638-ceb4-42cc-b294-cf11862e0383")
	)
	(text_box "• Operating range: VM = 5.1V to 18V | I_peak = 6A\n• Current limit (I_TRIP): ~2.6A (VREF = 2.50V via 15k/47k divider, R_IPROPI = 2.49kΩ)\n• Current sense (IPROPI): 455 µA/A → ~1.13 V/A (RC filter fc ≈ 16 kHz)\n• Control mode: PMODE selectable | NFAULT: Open-drain (10kΩ pull-up)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 176.53 146.1278 0)
		(size 102.87 10.0822)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
		(stroke
			(width 0)
			(type solid)
		)
		(fill
			(type none)
		)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "9a5abc10-7a2f-48b0-aa8d-73a9ee709711")
	)
	(text_box "• Common Anode (+3.3V) | Active-LOW sink to MCU PWM pins\n• Red:   VF ≈ 2.0V | R = 330 Ω  ->  IF ≈ 3.9 mA\n• Green: VF ≈ 2.85V | R = 180 Ω  ->  IF ≈ 2.5 mA\n• Blue:  VF ≈ 2.85V | R = 180 Ω  ->  IF ≈ 2.5 mA\n• Balanced current ratios for natural white point (< 9 mA total)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 17.78 96.52 0)
		(size 76.2 12.1268)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
